{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018a.q28.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：与分封制相适应，商周的官员选拔采用“世卿世禄制”。三代（夏商周）时期治理国家的统治者是贵族，……从诸侯到士，根据出身的高低贵贱来兼任政府职务，世代为官……春秋时期，随着兼并战争的进行，秦、楚等国都在新占领的地方上设立县和郡，作为新的行政建制。一般县在中心区域，郡在边远地区。郡县的长官，不再是世袭领主，而是由君主委派官员直接管理。郡县长官由君主任免，对君主负责，成为中国历史上最早的取代贵族领主的职业官僚。——摘编自张岂之《中国历史十五讲》材料二：北宋规定郡长官由文臣担任，长官之外另设“通判”使其互相牵制……除安抚使用武人，其余都由文臣担任。 ——摘编自朱绍侯《中国古代史》", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f61531ee681e04c4e97bc7d66664b5cb467a195f0a20662d8352e93cd89f8fa0", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2589, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2881, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f61531ee681e04c4e97bc7d66664b5cb467a195f0a20662d8352e93cd89f8fa0"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018a.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.410.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2018a.q28"], "word_count": 292, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f61531ee681e04c4e97bc7d66664b5cb467a195f0a20662d8352e93cd89f8fa0", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2589, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2881, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2018年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status"